      "comment": "Octavia: Miliastra Wonderland",
      "content": "Miliastra Wonderland is a pocket realm created by Octavia that can be shaped as its creator wishes. In the quest The Gardener the Hexenzirkel gives the Traveler the Wonderland Cosmosphere, a key to it. The item text says Octavia has watched the Traveler and Paimon and judged them the ideal new masters.\n\nShe also gave them a pair of Manekin avatars, whose outfits come from her wardrobe.",
